              </li>
            </ul>
            <div className="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/20">
              <p className="text-white font-semibold mb-2 text-sm md:text-base">Pondelok – Piatok:</p>
              <p className="text-white text-sm md:text-base">09:00 – 12:00 a 13:00 – 15:00</p>
